## Slide 25

Workflow Troubleshooting

## Slide 26

Troubleshooting

Use the Validate option in the Visual Editor
Process Step History record State Data
Timestamps 
Results
Parameters
A Workflow Service has individual Logs and Content Pages for troubleshooting
Process Definition are Versioned, allowing drafts and retired copies to be inspected

## Slide 27

Error Handling

Create Process Step Paths that account for all possible results
Success
Timeout
Error
Use timeouts on steps keep process moving if data is not received
Use multiple end steps help kill processes to ensure completion

